,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Definition check first:** confirm tracking error is the annualized standard deviation of daily *NAV* total-return differences against the correct index variant (gross/net). Check that dates and holidays align and that market price wasn't used by mistake.\n\n**Portfolio causes**\n- Sampling/optimization versus full replication.\n- Cash drag from uninvested dividends or flows; futures/equitization basis.\n- Rebalance and index-change timing: early/late trades, missed adds/deletes.\n- Corporate actions: spin-offs, mergers, rights.\n- Securities-lending recalls.\n\n**Pricing causes**\n- Fund versus index pricing sources and close times.\n- Fair-value or stale-price adjustments.\n- Dividend ex-date accrual and reinvestment assumptions.\n- Halted or illiquid names.\n\n**Operating causes**\n- Trade, allocation or settlement errors.\n- Large creations/redemptions executed away from the close.\n- Fee/expense accrual misstatements.\n- Index-data or holdings-file errors.\n- Reconciliation breaks.\n\nSeparate recurring drivers from one-off outlier days, and attribute each via daily return decomposition.","ttft_ms":1846,"type":"result","duration_ms":4544,"uuid":"5bf781f8-0b8c-4d54-8d7f-9ed74868f881","ttft_stream_ms":1200,"time_to_request_ms":65,"first_content_frame_ms":1200,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
